{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation with pca_n2000 encoder in multiprofile RNA-only models. Validation accuracy (0.519) is lower than the scvi_n200 transformer baseline (0.653), suggesting pca_n2000 may not benefit as much from transformer aggregation. However, the absence of direct comparisons to other aggregation methods or encoder variations leaves uncertainty about the method's general effectiveness in this context."
}

